    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113435" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰροπ-ότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>brightness of eye,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Stoic.
				3.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archyt.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cat.</u>
				93.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				807.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>light-blue colour,</i> of the eyes of the Germans, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				11
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθέριος χ.,</span> of
				sky-<i>blue,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.352d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>brightness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cat.</u>
				298.15
			</span></i>.</div>
